<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 1: </span>Evaluation results on WildSeek dataset comparing ConvergeWriter with baselines. Metrics include: average article length (Length), average cited documents per article (Cite Docs), LLM-based rubric scores across four dimensions + average (Rubric Grading), and average document coverage percentage (Coverage %).</figcaption>
